    "source_text": "diacetoxypalladium (11.21 mg, 0.05 mmol) and (9,9-dimethyl-9H-xanthene-4,5-diyl)bis(diphenylphosphine) (28.9 mg, 0.05 mmol) were dissolved in toluene (0.5 mL) under nitrogen. Stirred at 50C for 30min.  sodium 2-methylpropan-2-olate (96 mg, 1.00 mmol) and piperazin-2-one (50 mg, 0.50 mmol) were added to a second microwave vial and inerted with nitrogen. 1-bromo-4-fluorobenzene (0.110 mL, 1.00 mmol) and toluene (0.500 mL) were added.  The catalyst solution wad added to the reaction mixture and the resulting solution was stirred at 100C for 1h in the microwave. No reaction. Heated to 150C for 1h, still no reaction, the reaction was discarded.  ",
